BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 571.97 Tm (The commission math is simple enough to run on a napkin, and the practitioners want owners to run it themselves.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 556.75 Tm (Benefits On The Fly's formula: take the monthly premium check, multiply by 5%, then by 12. Their worked case is 50) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 541.52 Tm (enrolled employees at $500 a month, a $25,000 monthly check or $300,000 a year, with $1,250 a month flowing back) Tj ET
