BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 511.07 Tm (ProPublica reported in 2019: on a $1 million plan that is $30,000 to $60,000 a year, and a 10% premium increase lifts it) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 495.85 Tm (10% [bmIls2hM4uk @ 00:02:59]. Benefits Blake scales it to a 250-life fully insured group paying $2 million at 5%, a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 480.62 Tm ($100,000 commission; a 10% renewal pushes premium to $2.2 million and the broker to $110,000, so the employer) Tj ET
