BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 343.60 Tm (not 'commissions vary,' and the last three years if you have never seen one. Enforcement is soft, with no filing and no) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 328.37 Tm (penalty schedule, but a missing disclosure makes the contract unreasonable and creates prohibited transaction exposure.) Tj ET
