BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 297.92 Tm (Blake pulls it on the EFAST2 search site in about two minutes and points out every other employer's filing is public) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 282.70 Tm (too, so you can benchmark peers your size in your area [m68BBrL5G18 @ 00:15:54]. The catch: Schedule A runs) Tj ET
