BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (The second split is between the physical-controls camp and the culture camp. RapidSync teaches a hardware-first) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (restaurant playbook: non-slip mats and wet-floor signs for slips, mesh gloves and training for burns and cuts, a UL300) Tj ET
