BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (and IIPP work as the foundation, not the program, and builds on six components: accountability with monthly) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (zero-injury goals and posted results, recognition, motivation, appreciation with a senior manager attending, teamwork) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (and peer pressure, and engagement, which Stevens rates as the hardest [XYYaHz216lk @ 00:28:44]. Stevens also flips) Tj ET
