BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (who spent about 8 years at Rawlings on the carrier side, rejects locking in early: pre-settlement deals with Rawlings run) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (on a sliding 40 to 50% scale that freezes a weaker reduction, and Kenyon pushes back on the 'sitting duck' view) Tj ET
